# skywright, up to speed for Bike Weather's core loop. Run by `bin/ws --project skywright chain plans/skywright/core-loop.queue`.
# <name> <task> [gate] [dispatch flags]. gate = the operator sees it before the merge.
sky-minutely   plans/skywright/task-sky-8-minutely.md
sky-dry-window plans/skywright/task-sky-9-dry-window.md
sky-interval   plans/skywright/task-sky-10-interval.md
sky-headwind   plans/skywright/task-sky-11-headwind.md
sky-met-norway plans/skywright/task-sky-12-met-norway.md
sky-fallback   plans/skywright/task-sky-13-fallback.md
